From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] rewrite: share metadata-preserving reparenting

Move descendant reparenting into a shared helper that retains complete
author and committer metadata. Recreate a signature when the original
commit was signed, or when the caller explicitly requires signing.

Use the helper in the push signing path so later metadata rewrites can
share the same semantics.
